# Coordinate probe for the DESK22 and DESK29 runs on THIS card image
# (tools/make-sd-image.sh changed with DESK18/DESK19: C:\CMDLINE.NCP and
# C:\SUB\CURDIR.NCP are new, so the C:\ window's item grid is not the one the
# DESK06 action lists used). probe_patch.py's `probe_icons` prints every
# desktop icon and every window item with the point that hits it; every click
# coordinate in d22.actions / d29.actions comes from this dump.
#
#   C: drive icon around (37,42) -- left of the first window's left edge (48),
#   so it stays clickable after a window is open.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 37 42
1700 down
1703 up
1710 down
1713 up
2300 move 600 240
2900 mark B_WIN1
3200 move 37 42
3400 down
3403 up
3410 down
3413 up
4000 move 600 240
4600 mark C_WIN2
5200 mark D_END
